  "outcomes": [
    "Explain how semantic HTML gives content a structure and CSS changes its presentation.",
    "Build readable pages with meaningful headings, links, images, and accessible navigation.",
    "Use selectors, the cascade, spacing, typography, Flexbox, and Grid to implement visual decisions.",
    "Adapt a layout to narrow and wide viewports and test keyboard access and zoom.",
    "Locate a fault, form a prediction, change source, and verify the result.",
    "Maintain one repository, commit changes, and publish a working static website.",
    "Credit sources and assets, disclose permitted AI assistance, and independently explain submitted code.",
    "Curate a portfolio that communicates design intent and evidence of learning."
  ],
